message: >-
  If you use Tomotok in a scientific publication, please cite the article below
  together with the references for the inversion methods used.
title: Tomotok
abstract: >-
  Python package for tomographic inversion of tokamak plasma radiation,
  focusing on inversion methods based on discretisation.
